{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_119_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_119","textTraditional":"一、五年，春，公如齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_119_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_119","textTraditional":"二、夏，公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_119_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_119","textTraditional":"三、秋，九月，齊高固來迎子叔姬。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_119_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_119","textTraditional":"諸侯之嫁子於大夫，主大夫以與之。來者，接內也。不正其接內，故不與夫婦之稱也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_119_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_119","textTraditional":"四、叔孫得臣卒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_119_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_119","textTraditional":"五、冬，齊高固及子叔姬來。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_119_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_119","textTraditional":"及者，及吾子叔姬也。為使來者，不使得歸之意也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_119_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_119","textTraditional":"六、楚人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}